    "sections": {
        "description": "Elara Nails And Beauty is a clean, minimalist WordPress theme designed to help beauty businesses turn visitors into paying clients. Built for nail salons, hair salons, spa and wellness studios, clinics, and esthetician services, it makes it easy to showcase treatments like manicure, pedicure, skincare, lashes, brow, makeup, cosmetic care, and massage in a way that feels both professional and inviting. With built-in booking and appointment sections, your service pages are structured to convert. The theme is powered by Gutenberg with full FSE (Full Site Editing), using a flexible block system that works smoothly with any page builder. You can create high-converting landing page layouts, one page sites, or full multi page business websites without complexity. Everything is simple to customize, from color choices to layout, including support for dark mode. Elara is fast, responsive, and mobile friendly, built with SEO and search engines in mind. It’s optimized as one of the fastest options for modern WordPress sites and integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce for ecommerce. Beyond beauty, it also works perfectly for any blogger, blogging, writers, writing, lifestyle, magazine, news, portfolio, affiliate marketing, startup, corporate company, or minimal business website — making it a cool, easy, and free solution for almost any project."
    },
